{"unit_id":"Lipraty__dsh-session-import#caveat-1","repo":"Lipraty/dsh-session-import","commit":"da9b58a132f3baae6cbb29099af84235626b5565","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Session Import 导入时使用当前 DSH 默认模型和 preset；源会话中的模型标签不会替换 DSH 当前模型路由。开始导入前需在 DSH 选好可用默认模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/native-activation.js:3-9","lib/mapper.js:895-900"]}
